  "title": "Ukraine's Ousted Defence Minister Calls for Wartime Election Amid Political Crisis",
  "summary": "Ukraine's ousted Defence Minister Mykhailo Fedorov has called for elections, despite the ongoing war with Russia, urging democratic renewal as the country faces a governance crisis. The move highlights his transition from a loyal insider to a potential political challenge for President Volodymyr Zelenskyy.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Ukraine's ousted Defence Minister Mykhailo Fedorov called for elections despite the war with Russia, citing a governance crisis.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
